    "description": "原评估无下降量字段；独立按保存参数与既有解析切换方程重算下降量，无新轨道。",
    "existing_relaxed_capacity_drop_source": "function drop=relaxed_capacity_drop(run)\n% 只用解析公式：容量放宽为 K+delta（delta 为重积分容量超出）时解析最优值的下降。\ndrop=NaN; delta=run.assessment.capacity_excess;\nif ~(isscalar(delta) && isfinite(delta) && delta>0), return; end\ntry\n    relaxed=numerical_normalize_parameters(run.parameters); relaxed.K=relaxed.K+delta;\n    wide=analytic_reference(relaxed,run.x0,build_theory_geometry(relaxed),0);\n    drop=run.reference.J_reference-wide.J_reference;\ncatch\n    drop=NaN;\nend\nend\n\n",
    "existing_relaxed_capacity_drop_source_sha256": "748863ca73dae430a2c321344dfca5821619806ffcb68d42d95d79607137190a",
    "formulas": [
      "a_K(z)=K+h-z+h*log(z/h)",
      "Theta(s,i)=(s-h)/(i*(s-p))",
      "i_f=a_K(z)+ell*log(s_f/z)",
      "Theta(s_f,i_f)=Theta(z,a_K(z))",
      "J_B=beta/(K*(1-beta))*(log(s_c/s_B)-beta*log((s_c-p)/(s_B-p)))",
      "J=J_B+beta*c/gamma*log(i_f/a_K(z))",
      "drop=J_reference(K)-J_analytic(K+capacity_excess)"
    ],
